@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071

### Get Latest Telemetry (Table Storage read)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/GetLatestTelemetry?fieldId=FIELD-A&take=10

### Trigger Irrigation - start (Queue write, picked up by ProcessIrrigationCommand)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/TriggerIrrigation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "DeviceId": "VALVE-001",
  "FieldId": "FIELD-A",
  "Action": "Start",
  "DurationMinutes": 45,
  "Source": "User",
  "RequestedBy": "local-test"
}

### Trigger Irrigation - automated sensor alert
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/TriggerIrrigation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "DeviceId": "VALVE-002",
  "FieldId": "FIELD-B",
  "Action": "Start",
  "DurationMinutes": 20,
  "Source": "Sensor",
  "RequestedBy": "SENSOR-B1"
}

### Trigger Irrigation - stop
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/TriggerIrrigation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "DeviceId": "VALVE-001",
  "FieldId": "FIELD-A",
  "Action": "Stop",
  "Source": "User",
  "RequestedBy": "local-test"
}

### LogDroneImageUpload is blob-triggered: upload TestFiles/sample-drone-image.jpg
### to the drone-images container (via the web app or Storage Explorer) to fire it.
